ed patterns\n\nReason: F3 is an isolated honor tile that doesn't contribute to any potential winning pattern. By discarding it, I maintain my Bamboo tile concentration, keeping alive the possibility of forming a Full Flush (24 points) or other high-value Bamboo-based patterns. This tile appears relatively safe based on the discard history.\n\nAnswer: Play F3"}
